{{template "base/head" .}}
<div role="main" aria-label="{{.Title}}" class="page-content repository">
	{{template "repo/header" .}}
	<div id="port-application-handoff" class="ui container">
		{{template "base/alert" .}}
		<section class="port-handoff-hero">
			<div class="port-handoff-check" aria-hidden="true">{{svg "octicon-git-branch" 28}}</div>
			<div>
				<p class="port-handoff-eyebrow">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_complete"}}</p>
				<h1>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_heading"}}</h1>
				<p>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_intro"}}</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<ol class="port-handoff-stepper" aria-label="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_label"}}">
			<li class="{{if .PortPushComplete}}completed{{else}}active{{end}}">
				<span class="port-step-number">{{if .PortPushComplete}}{{svg "octicon-check" 16}}{{else}}1{{end}}</span>
				<span><strong>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_push"}}</strong><small>{{if .PortPushComplete}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_done"}}{{else}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_current"}}{{end}}</small></span>
			</li>
			<li class="{{if or .PortMigrationStaged .PortMigrationActive}}completed{{else if .PortPushComplete}}active{{else}}locked{{end}}">
				<span class="port-step-number">{{if or .PortMigrationStaged .PortMigrationActive}}{{svg "octicon-check" 16}}{{else}}2{{end}}</span>
				<span><strong>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_identity"}}</strong><small>{{if or .PortMigrationStaged .PortMigrationActive}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_done"}}{{else if .PortPushComplete}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_current"}}{{else}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_locked"}}{{end}}</small></span>
			</li>
			<li class="{{if .PortMigrationActive}}completed{{else if .PortMigrationStaged}}active{{else}}locked{{end}}">
				<span class="port-step-number">{{if .PortMigrationActive}}{{svg "octicon-check" 16}}{{else}}3{{end}}</span>
				<span><strong>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_activate"}}</strong><small>{{if .PortMigrationActive}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_done"}}{{else if .PortMigrationStaged}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_current"}}{{else}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.flow_locked"}}{{end}}</small></span>
			</li>
		</ol>

		{{if not .PortPushComplete}}
			<section class="port-handoff-section port-current-step" aria-labelledby="port-agent-heading">
				<p class="port-handoff-kicker">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.step_one"}}</p>
				<h2 id="port-agent-heading">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_agent_title"}}</h2>
				<p>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_agent_help"}}</p>
				<div class="clone-panel ui action small input port-clone-panel">
					{{template "repo/clone_buttons" .}}
				</div>
				<div class="port-agent-prompt-box">
					<div class="port-agent-prompt-toolbar">
						<span>{{svg "octicon-copilot" 16}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_prompt_label"}}</span>
						<button type="button" class="ui small primary button" data-clipboard-target="#port-agent-prompt">{{svg "octicon-copy" 16}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_copy_prompt"}}</button>
					</div>
					<pre id="port-agent-prompt" tabindex="0"><code>You are migrating an existing application into its new GitW3 repository. Work in the application's existing local Git checkout and preserve its code and commit history.

Destination:
- GitW3 remote: <span class="js-clone-url">{{.CloneButtonOriginLink.HTTPS}}</span>
- GitW3 default branch: {{.Repository.DefaultBranch}}
- W3DS manifest path: .w3ds/platform.json

Before editing anything:
1. Inspect the repository, its current branch and remotes, and any existing .w3ds directory or W3DS eName.
2. Install and use the W3DS skill with `npx skills add MetaState-Prototype-Project/prototype@w3ds` so the integration follows the current W3DS protocol, ontology identifiers, mapping rules, and eVault APIs.
3. Show me a concise plan and report whether this application is new to W3DS, already has an unclaimed manifest, or already has an eName.

Then complete the migration safely:
1. Preserve existing application behavior and Git history. Make only the W3DS integration changes the application actually needs.
2. If no W3DS manifest exists and the application has no existing W3DS identity, create a valid .w3ds/platform.json for this application with `ename` set to null. Infer metadata from the application, but ask me before guessing any product-facing name, description, URL, or domain selection.
3. If .w3ds already exists, preserve valid configuration and update it only where required. If an existing eName is present, do not remove, replace, or claim it and do not create a second identity. Keep it intact; GitW3 will transfer it in the next step after this push.
4. Never invent migration proofs, W3DS tokens, eNames, ontology identifiers, API endpoints, or credentials. Never commit secrets.
5. Make GitW3 the new `origin`. If `origin` already exists, preserve it by renaming it to the first available upstream-style name (`upstream`, `upstream-2`, and so on). If no `origin` exists, add GitW3 directly as `origin`.
6. Configure `origin` as <span class="js-clone-url">{{.CloneButtonOriginLink.HTTPS}}</span> and push the current HEAD to `{{.Repository.DefaultBranch}}` with upstream tracking.
7. Run the relevant tests or checks before pushing. Do not force-push or rewrite history unless I explicitly approve it.

At the end, report:
- the W3DS state you found;
- files changed;
- remotes before and after;
- checks run;
- the exact branch and commit pushed;
- anything still requiring my action.

Stop and ask me before proceeding if authentication fails, the destination is not empty, histories conflict, an existing W3DS identity would be replaced, or a safe push requires rewriting history.</code></pre>
				</div>
				<div class="port-handoff-note">
					{{svg "octicon-shield-lock" 16}} <span>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_prompt_safety"}}</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<details class="port-handoff-section port-manual-details">
				<summary>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_manual_title"}}</summary>
				<p>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_manual_help"}}</p>
				<div class="port-manual-command">
					<div class="port-agent-prompt-toolbar">
						<span>{{svg "octicon-terminal" 16}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_commands_label"}}</span>
						<button type="button" class="ui small button" data-clipboard-target="#port-manual-commands">{{svg "octicon-copy" 16}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "copy"}}</button>
					</div>
					<pre id="port-manual-commands" tabindex="0"><code># Run inside the existing application's Git checkout.
# If origin already exists, preserve it first (use upstream-2 if upstream is taken):
git remote rename origin upstream

git remote add origin <span class="js-clone-url">{{.CloneButtonOriginLink.HTTPS}}</span>
git push -u origin HEAD:{{.Repository.DefaultBranch}}</code></pre>
				</div>
				<p class="port-manual-caveat">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_manual_caveat"}}</p>
			</details>

			<div class="port-step-actions">
				<a class="ui button" href="{{.RepoLink}}">{{svg "octicon-repo"}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_open_repo"}}</a>
				<a class="ui primary button" href="{{.RepoLink}}/onboarding/port">{{svg "octicon-sync"}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.check_push"}}</a>
			</div>
		{{else if not (or .PortMigrationStaged .PortMigrationActive)}}
			<section class="port-step-complete" aria-label="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.step_one_complete"}}">
				{{svg "octicon-check-circle-fill" 20}} <span><strong>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.step_one_complete"}}</strong> {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.step_one_complete_help"}}</span>
			</section>
			<section class="port-handoff-section port-current-step port-identity-section" aria-labelledby="port-identity-heading">
				<p class="port-handoff-kicker">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.step_two"}}</p>
				<h2 id="port-identity-heading">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_title"}}</h2>
				<p>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_help_ready"}}</p>
				{{if .PortManifestInvalid}}
					<div class="ui negative message">
						<div class="header">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_manifest_invalid_title"}}</div>
						<p>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_manifest_invalid"}}</p>
					</div>
				{{else}}
					<form id="platform-identity-migration-form" class="ui form" action="{{.RepoLink}}/onboarding/port/migrate" method="post" data-platform-port>
						{{.CsrfTokenHtml}}
						<div class="two fields">
							<div class="required field"><label for="port-platform-ename">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.ename"}}</label><input id="port-platform-ename" name="ename" required maxlength="255" placeholder="@your-platform"></div>
							<div class="required field"><label for="port-platform-token">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.token"}}</label><input id="port-platform-token" name="token" type="password" required maxlength="32768" autocomplete="off"></div>
						</div>
						<div class="port-identity-footer">
							<p>{{svg "octicon-shield-lock" 16}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.token_privacy"}}</p>
							<button class="ui primary button" type="submit" data-platform-port-submit>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.authorize"}}</button>
						</div>
					</form>
					<dialog id="platform-port-signing-modal">
						<div class="header">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.signing_title"}}</div>
						<div class="content w3ds-ppa-signing-content">
							<p>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.signing_help"}}</p>
							<div class="w3ds-ppa-signing-qr"><canvas data-platform-port-qr aria-label="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.ppa.signing_qr"}}"></canvas></div>
							<a class="ui primary button" data-platform-port-open href="#">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.ppa.signing_open"}}</a>
							<p class="w3ds-ppa-signing-status" data-platform-port-status data-starting="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.ppa.signing_starting"}}" data-waiting="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.signing_waiting"}}" data-complete="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.signing_complete"}}" data-failed="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.signing_failed"}}" aria-live="polite"></p>
						</div>
						<div class="actions"><button class="ui button" data-modal-close>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "cancel"}}</button></div>
					</dialog>
				{{end}}
			</section>
			<section class="port-identity-alternatives">
				<div><strong>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_none_title"}}</strong><span>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_none_help"}}</span><a href="{{.RepoLink}}/w3ds">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_none_action"}} {{svg "octicon-arrow-right" 14}}</a></div>
				<div><strong>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_later_title"}}</strong><span>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_later"}}</span><a href="{{.RepoLink}}">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_open_repo"}} {{svg "octicon-arrow-right" 14}}</a></div>
			</section>
		{{else}}
			<section class="port-step-complete" aria-label="{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_complete"}}">
				{{svg "octicon-check-circle-fill" 20}} <span><strong>{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_complete"}}</strong> {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.identity_complete_help"}}</span>
			</section>
			<section class="port-handoff-section port-current-step" aria-labelledby="port-activate-heading">
				<p class="port-handoff-kicker">{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.step_three"}}</p>
				<h2 id="port-activate-heading">{{if .PortMigrationActive}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.cutover_complete_title"}}{{else}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.cutover_title"}}{{end}}</h2>
				<p>{{if .PortMigrationActive}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.cutover_complete_help"}}{{else}}{{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.cutover_help"}}{{end}}</p>
				<div class="port-step-actions">
					<a class="ui button" href="{{.RepoLink}}">{{svg "octicon-repo"}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.handoff_open_repo"}}</a>
					{{if not .PortMigrationActive}}<a class="ui primary button" href="{{.RepoLink}}/w3ds">{{svg "octicon-shield-check"}} {{ctx.Locale.Tr "platform.port.cutover_action"}}</a>{{end}}
				</div>
			</section>
		{{end}}
		{{template "repo/clone_script" .}}
	</div>
</div>
{{template "base/footer" .}}
